  "brief": { "zh": "让风车擂台上的三台对手机器人全部停机。两名守点手隔着风车叶片看守南北两翼，巡场手会绕掩体追来。第 8 和 17 回合结束时中央风口换边。增幅芯片可以叠加，脉冲会被墙挡住。芽芽须在第 48 回合结束前获胜并保留电量。", "en": "Tag out all three robots in the pinwheel arena. Two sentries watch the north and south wings, while a roamer chases around the blades. Vents in the central wheel change sides after turns 8 and 17. Power chips stack and walls block pulses. Win with power remaining by the end of turn 48." },
